  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">KRS ESSOR Honey Production and Marketing</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ets KRS Essor Collines International, a small and medium enterprise founded by Rami Soumanou, The company offers an alternative to the consumption of synthetic sugars by offering different types of honey, including neem honey, cashew honey and polyfloral honey. The project proposal aims to increase the company&apos;s competitiveness by expanding and modernizing its honey factory. It will also strengthen the network cluster-based honeycomb and beeswax supply system between the beekeeping and cashew product value chains.</narrative>
  </description>
